Description: System tray toolkit for Ubuntu/GNOME
 Sysbar groups six utilities in a single tray application: system monitor,
 per-application volume mixer, keep awake, auto-quit, uninstaller and shelf.
 Every feature is opt-in and degrades gracefully when a dependency, extension
 or session capability is missing. Local only, no account, no telemetry.
